      "body": "Use <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msqrt><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></math> when evaluating the upper endpoint. Evaluate the lower endpoint separately before subtracting.",
